This product is the FSOT genetics and protein structure formula branch:
zero free parameters, F01-F15 closed forms, and an AlphaFold head-to-head
comparison (not a neural net).

This repository is part of the FSOT (Fluid Spacetime Omni-Theory) family.
Theory authority is vendor/fsot_compute.py in
https://github.com/dappalumbo91/FSOT-2.1-Lean (pin AEB2AD), also by
Damian Arthur Palumbo and licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Rust crate dependencies (not bundled, fetched by Cargo; see Cargo.toml)
remain under their own licenses.
